ABOVE THE STORM

Photorealistic IMAX orbital cinematography. 8K HUD.
Colossal rusted orbital megastructure colony with dense industrial towers, antennas, fuel tanks, scaffolding, exposed cables and massive engine bells. Weathered metal surfaces, maintenance structures, drifting debris. Earth below covered by a gigantic rotating electric superstorm over the ocean. Blue lightning webs across cloud layers, violent storm rotation, hyper-real volumetric atmosphere, plasma ionization, realistic orbital physics, dramatic scale.

Sound Effects (very important)
These should carry the realism.
Storm Layer

Constant background:
distant thunder
electrical crackling
atmospheric wind shear

Hull Sounds
During early shots:
metal creaking
cable tension snapping
structural vibration

Engine Ignition
Layered sound:
1️⃣ deep rocket thunder
2️⃣ turbine roar
3️⃣ sub-bass shockwave
Think Saturn V launch scale.

Electrical Interaction
When lightning attaches to the plume:
plasma crackle
electric arcs
ionized hiss
Almost like Tesla coil energy.

Explosions
Not Hollywood.
Use:
tank rupture BOOM
